Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 08:08:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Mamuta lane: opt-in P2 Miulin bury semantics for bound
 Miurin actors

Add pc_p2_mamuta_rules (P2_MAMUTA_RULES_1 marker, room preview only):
Pikmin receiver converts to flower-stage planted sprout via PIKISTATE_Bury
with the P2 99-planted cap, non-bald safe-ground and +-20 vertical gates;
captain receiver is damage-only (5.0, no burial). Tri-state consults wired
into InteractBury::actPiki / actNavi ahead of the unmodified P1 path for
actors bound by pc_p2_mamuta (family lane #221, ID 54 Miulin).
